WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:03.980
Today's changing world needs
principled leaders who are inentional

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:08.430
about developing their own personal
leadership competencies and values.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:12.196
This is why we're so excited about this
new course which will be the foundation

00:00:12.196 --> 00:00:14.549
for the lead personal
leadership certificate.

00:00:14.549 --> 00:00:16.877
Brian, can you tell us a little
bit more about the course?

00:00:16.877 --> 00:00:18.240
&gt;&gt; Of course.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.928
So in this course, we're going to blend
research, practical exercises, and

00:00:21.928 --> 00:00:25.843
a 360 tool, so the participants in the
course will be able to better craft their

00:00:25.843 --> 00:00:27.565
own personal leadership journey.

00:00:27.565 --> 00:00:31.297
So who is the course for, Sara?
&gt;&gt; So this course is terrific for

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:34.233
the new leader, as well as for
the seasoned executive.

00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:37.598
New leaders will learn about their
own strengths and weaknesses and

00:00:37.598 --> 00:00:41.435
use this information to both craft their
own personal leadership journey and

00:00:41.435 --> 00:00:44.330
chart their course
through the certificate.

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:49.012
But because personal leadership is always
an evolving journey, it's important for

00:00:49.012 --> 00:00:53.174
the more seasoned leader to examine
their leadership habits critically and

00:00:53.174 --> 00:00:55.205
make course corrections as needed.

00:00:55.205 --> 00:00:58.943
In other words, we've designed
this course to be useful for

00:00:58.943 --> 00:01:00.932
both new and seasoned leaders.

00:01:00.932 --> 00:01:04.130
Brian, tell us a little
more about how the course

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.721
is set up.
&gt;&gt; This course provides leadership lessons

00:01:06.721 --> 00:01:09.679
from a number of experts who will
share their own unique knowledge

00:01:09.679 --> 00:01:10.504
of a given topic.

00:01:10.504 --> 00:01:14.829
The topics we have curated for the course
focus on building the core competencies of

00:01:14.829 --> 00:01:18.662
personal leadership, which are self
awareness, perspective taking,

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:22.741
awareness of the context in which
interaction takes place, communication,

00:01:22.741 --> 00:01:25.561
and decision making.
&gt;&gt; Participants

00:01:25.561 --> 00:01:29.531
will leave this course with a much deeper
knowledge about themselves as leaders,

00:01:29.531 --> 00:01:33.515
and this will allow them to begin to chart
their own personal leadership journey.

